{"id":2674,"age":32,"sex":"M","race":"Non-Hispanic White","insurance":"Employer-sponsored health insurance (PPO)","profile":{"sex":"M","allergies":["NKDA"],"insurance":"Employer-sponsored health insurance (PPO)","occupation":"Machine operator (night shift) at box manufacturing plant; freelance technical writer (remote)","alcohol_use":"None","family_history":["Noncontributory"],"race_ethnicity":"Non-Hispanic White","smoking_status":"Never smoker","home_medications":[],"surgical_history":[],"chronic_conditions":[],"age_at_first_encounter":32},"comorbidities_listed":[],"primary":{"did":6586,"code":"F60.1","name":"Schizoid personality disorder"},"filing":{"chapter":5,"block":"F60-F69","block_desc":"Disorders of adult personality and behavior (F60-F69)"},"encounters":[{"id":11207,"date":"2020-01-15","type":"outpatient","dept":"Internal Medicine","attending":"Dr. Sarah Chen","cc":"Routine health examination. Patient reports no interest in romantic relationships and prefers solitary activities such as reading and programming.","order":0,"method":"template","question_ids":[4061],"sections":[{"sid":47881,"type":"chief_complaint","lines":["Routine health examination.","Patient reports no interest in romantic relationships and prefers solitary activities such as reading and programming."]},{"sid":47882,"type":"hpi","lines":["He mentions that he has never been in a romantic relationship and has no interest in being in one.","He has a few acquaintances but prefers to spend his free time alone, engaging in solitary activities such as reading and programming.","He denies any desire for closer relationships and appears indifferent to the praise or criticism of others."]},{"sid":47883,"type":"pmh","lines":["His medical history is unremarkable, and he denies any significant past psychiatric history."]},{"sid":47884,"type":"medications","lines":["He is not currently on any medications."]},{"sid":47885,"type":"allergies","lines":["NKDA"]},{"sid":47886,"type":"family_history","lines":["- Noncontributory"]},{"sid":47887,"type":"social_history","lines":["He has no history of substance abuse."]},{"sid":47888,"type":"physical_exam","lines":["On examination, he is neatly dressed, makes minimal eye contact, and answers questions in a brief and detached manner.","He denies any history of hallucinations, delusions, or odd beliefs and behaviors.","His mood is described as \"neutral,\" and affect is restricted."]},{"sid":47889,"type":"labs","lines":["Laboratory tests, including a complete blood count, comprehensive metabolic panel, and thyroid function tests, are within normal limits."]}],"orders":[]},{"id":11209,"date":"2021-01-15","type":"outpatient","dept":"Occupational Health","attending":"Dr. Marcus Johnson","cc":"Annual physical examination required by employer for machine operator position. Supervisor notes he prefers night shifts and rarely interacts with coworkers beyond necessary work tasks.","order":1,"method":"hybrid","question_ids":[5678],"sections":[{"sid":47890,"type":"chief_complaint","lines":["Annual physical examination required by employer for machine operator position.","Supervisor notes he prefers night shifts and rarely interacts with coworkers beyond necessary work tasks."]},{"sid":47891,"type":"hpi","lines":["The patient returns for an annual occupational health examination required by his employer, approximately one year following his initial outpatient assessment where he reported disinterest in romantic relationships and preference for solitary pursuits.","He often volunteers for the late-night shift because, as he says, \"it's quieter when no one's around.\" His supervisor notes that he is punctual, completes his tasks efficiently, and never causes conflict, but also rarely interacts with coworkers beyond what is necessary to get the job done.","On further questioning, he says that he has no hobbies involving social interaction, preferring solitary activities like building cardboard sculptures from discarded factory material and reading technical manuals.","He is not distressed by his solitary lifestyle and describes it as \"comfortable and efficient.\" He does not express any feelings of sadness or hopelessness and denies changes in sleep or appetite.","He has never had hallucinations, delusions, or disorganized thinking, and there is no history of manic or hypomanic episodes.","When asked about his childhood, the patient reports being \"the quiet kid\" who enjoyed sitting in the library rather than playing games with classmates.","Teachers described him as intelligent but difficult to engage socially.","He recalls no history of trauma, bullying, or abuse."]},{"sid":47892,"type":"pmh","lines":["Active Problem List:","- Schizoid personality disorder (diagnosed 2020-01-15)"]},{"sid":47893,"type":"medications","lines":["He takes no medications"]},{"sid":47894,"type":"allergies","lines":["NKDA"]},{"sid":47895,"type":"family_history","lines":["- Noncontributory"]},{"sid":47896,"type":"social_history","lines":["He works at a local box manufacturing plant, where his duties involve operating the machine that folds and glues cardboard into shipping boxes.","He has worked there for nearly 8 years.","The patient lives alone in a small apartment within walking distance of the plant.","His evenings are typically spent on his computer, where he tinkers with spreadsheets and organizes folders containing years of personal data, such as electricity usage and the number of steps he takes daily.","He reports no close friends and does not maintain regular contact with his family, though he sends his mother an occasional birthday email.","He has never been married and states that he has \"never been interested in dating\" because he \"doesn't see the point of it.\" He denies alcohol, tobacco, or illicit drug use."]},{"sid":47897,"type":"physical_exam","lines":["On mental status examination, the patient is alert, oriented, and appropriately groomed for the visit.","His speech is sparse but coherent.","Affect is flat, and mood is described as \"fine.\" Thought process is linear, and thought content is normal.","Insight into his social detachment is limited, but he does not view it as a problem."]},{"sid":47898,"type":"labs","lines":["Laboratory studies, including complete blood count, metabolic panel, and thyroid function tests, are normal."]},{"sid":47899,"type":"assessment","lines":["The physician notes that the patient meets his occupational health requirements and is medically cleared for continued employment."]},{"sid":47900,"type":"plan","lines":["However, the provider considers a psychiatric referral for further evaluation given the pattern of lifelong social detachment and limited emotional expression."]}],"orders":[]},{"id":11208,"date":"2022-01-15","type":"outpatient","dept":"Psychiatry","attending":"Dr. Aisha Patel","cc":"Sister expressed concern that he 'never connects with anyone.' Patient works from home and spends time on solitary activities including single-player games and late-night walks alone.","order":2,"method":"hybrid","question_ids":[5677],"sections":[{"sid":47901,"type":"chief_complaint","lines":["Sister expressed concern that he 'never connects with anyone.' Patient works from home and spends time on solitary activities including single-player games and late-night walks alone."]},{"sid":47902,"type":"hpi","lines":["The patient returns for ongoing outpatient psychiatric care, with prior encounters in 2020 and 2021 documenting persistent preference for solitary activities and limited social interaction.","He works as a freelance technical writer from home and has had the same one-room apartment for 8 years.","He spends most days researching obscure historical topics, playing single-player computer games, and walking alone late at night.","He states that he has never had a romantic relationship and cannot recall the last time he met with a friend in person.","He describes family gatherings as \u201cdraining\u201d and usually leaves early without speaking to many people."]},{"sid":47903,"type":"pmh","lines":["Active Problem List:","- Schizoid personality disorder (diagnosed 2020-01-15)"]},{"sid":47904,"type":"allergies","lines":["NKDA"]},{"sid":47905,"type":"family_history","lines":["- Noncontributory"]},{"sid":47906,"type":"social_history","lines":["Smoking: Never smoker.","Alcohol: None.","Occupation: Machine operator (night shift) at box manufacturing plant; freelance technical writer (remote)."]},{"sid":47907,"type":"ros","lines":["He denies sadness, loss of interest in activities, changes in sleep or appetite, or suicidal thoughts.","He also denies suspiciousness, magical thinking, or perceptual disturbances.","He reports satisfaction with his lifestyle and says he feels \u201cbest when left alone.\u201d"]},{"sid":47908,"type":"physical_exam","lines":["Mental status examination shows a flat affect, brief responses, and minimal spontaneous speech.","His thought process is linear and goal directed, with no evidence of hallucinations or delusions."]}],"orders":[]}],"problems":[{"did":6586,"code":"F60.1","name":"Schizoid personality disorder","icd_desc":"Schizoid personality disorder","snomed":"52954000","snomed_desc":"Schizoid personality disorder","category":"Psychiatric","acuity":"chronic","kind":"chronic","first_enc":11207,"chapter":5,"block":"F60-F69","docs":[{"enc":11207,"how":"encounter diagnosis"},{"enc":11209,"how":"encounter diagnosis"},{"enc":11208,"how":"encounter diagnosis"}],"primary":true}],"findings":[{"i":0,"fid":5511,"enc":11207,"sid":47883,"line":null,"name":"Software developer occupation","type":"history_item","snomed":"650981000124102","snomed_desc":"Software engineer","loinc":null,"loinc_desc":null,"normal":null,"value":"software developer","num":null,"present":1,"relevance":"background","links":[]},{"i":1,"fid":8350,"enc":11207,"sid":47882,"line":1,"name":"Lives alone","type":"history_item","snomed":"105529008","snomed_desc":"Lives alone","loinc":null,"loinc_desc":null,"normal":null,"valu